{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>BEFORE PURCHASING PLEASE VISIT THE WEBSITE FOR MORE INFORMATION ABOUT THIS PROJECT AND ITS CURRENT STATE.</strong><br><strong> </strong><br> <br><strong>Hope is Fading</strong>\u00a0is set in the distant future, where you play a robotic character lost and separated from its combat unit. Facing a losing battle, you are the last hope against the relentless corrupted machines that are pulling the world apart. <strong> </strong> <br> <br><strong>Complete a Failed Mission in a Ruined World</strong>  <br>Step into the aftermath of a catastrophic event, where everything now lies in rust and ruin.\u00a0It\u2019s your job to pick up the pieces of a mission left incomplete.   <br>  <br><strong>Confront the Horde</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight off swarms of robotic combat units designed for war.  <br>Survive encounters with zombie like wanderers who stagger through the wreckage.  <br> <br><strong>Scavenge and Craft</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Track down raw materials and blueprints scattered throughout the environment or looted from defeated enemies. <br>Forge stronger armor that boosts your resilience against overwhelming odds  <br> <br><strong>Energy Management</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Keep a close eye on your power core, ensuring your energy levels remain high enough for crucial abilities.<strong>  </strong><br> <br><strong>Weapon Upgrades</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enhance damage output, reload speed, or  customize crosshairs.  <br> </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3486780?t=1745224964","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3486780?t=1745224964","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486780/8f6211042f47e2c797b847733c7d7fd8f290aa9b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745224964","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_it